      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "HAVOC ONE (1) is in top form lately including a fast win at this track in 22.94 two back then backing it up with a 23.10 victory at Richmond over 401m latest. Clocking fast times and looks a key chance again here. CHEEKY EDGE (3) is worth forgiving for her last effort when fifth (19.35) at this track over 320m. Safe beginner who has drawn to advantage. Cannot be underestimated. SODA SWAN (8) is a capable type and proved too classy last time to win by half a length at this track in a handy 18.68 beating Paw Kara. Has never been out of the placings from two starts out of this box. Can make it back-to-back wins. GOT A PUNCH (7) jumps at a shorter trip and still warrants respect.",
